Subject: [PATCH] Render agent cursors from the current human cursor image with a lifetime tint

Apply after niri-ipc-tiled-window-position.patch and niri-agent-input.patch.
Reuse CursorManager theme selection, animation frames and CursorTextureCache.
Tint only the independent agent render elements, including client cursor surfaces.
Optional agent_id keeps the context tint stable across windows and indicator expiry.
A FIFO cache holds at most 128 contexts and preserves active contexts. Random
hash keys keep colors stable after eviction. Legacy requests share a default context.

